{"id":"seguro","lemma":"seguro","pos":"adj","rank":138,"glosses":["secure; safe (free from danger)","certain; sure; positive; definite (of being correct)","secure; firm; stable; reliable; surefire; foolproof (not likely to fall)"],"ipa":"/seˈɡuɾo/","forms":{"feminine":"segura","masculinePlural":"seguros","femininePlural":"seguras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-seguro.wav","formAudio":{"segura":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-B25es-Segura.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"No estoy tan seguro.","en":"I'm not so sure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441987"},{"text":"Quiero que estés segura.","en":"I want you to be safe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454415"},{"text":"Vosotros estáis seguros aquí.","en":"You are safe here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448580"},{"text":"¿Estáis seguras de esto?","en":"Are you certain about this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78812"},{"text":"Eso no es seguro.","en":"That's not safe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442078"}]}